  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Assistance from the World Heritage Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This reserve fund established by the World Heritage Convention is part of the World Heritage Fund. It supports the States Parties to the World Heritage Convention to face severe damage that occurred to the cultural or natural sites located on their territories and inscribed on the World Heritage List.
The World Heritage Committee has voted a budget of US$400,000 under this reserve fund for 2024-2025.</narrative>
